# Golden vectors of the in-game HUD: func_80047BE8 (gEmitHudGouraudBar) and the rectangle
# layout it emits, taken from the retail routine itself.
#
# Generated by running the original src/game/80047BE8.c in a host harness (only the MIPS
# register/asm attributes stripped); the packet fields below are the words the routine writes
# into the primitive pool, and the rectangles are the recorded gEmitTranslucentTileRect calls
# with the doubled coordinates already halved to the 320x240 screen space.
